{
  "_comment": "Kit manifest for marco portable project CLI. JSON format chosen over YAML to keep marco_cli.py stdlib-only (zero external deps). Version is the kit version, bumped independently of the proposal framework. kit_paths are SOURCE paths in this repo (the LaTeX skeleton lives in plantilla/, which init-run.sh copies into each run's redaccion/). Unlisted files MUST NOT be installed. preserve_paths is everything an upgrade must never overwrite: the whole proposals/ tree (runs, local registry, pointer) plus project-local config.",
